\pard\b\fs20 Year 356: Avalanche Alert in Urli (unfinished but playable)\b0\par
\fs16\par
A large gold vein has been discovered in Urli! A pioneer team set up a mine there. But before our miners can move in, we still have to make preparations. The settlement has no power yet, and running a power plant is not possible here: too few staff, and living conditions too poor. We have now put the nearby "generator castle" Wipfenstein back into operation, so all that remains is to lay an overhead line from there to the mine. But it will not last long while stubborn mules and radical robbers still roam the valleys. That is why an avalanche warning siren system has to be set up. Careful, don't talk too loud: danger of avalanches!\par
\par
\b Goal:\b0\par
Build a siren on every snow-covered peak and connect the substation to the mine (power pylons are needed).\par
\par
\b Tip:\b0\par
The substation must/can be tapped for your own buildings.\par
